    "detailed_description": "Game name: DarkHospital<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGenre: Horror Adventure<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRelease date: Scheduled for January<br />\r\n<br />\r\noverview:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou are trapped in a certain abandoned hospital. A ferocious dragon is roaming around the hospital. You aim to escape from the hospital while facing the dragon.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe hospital used to be a hospital. However, due to an accident, the hospital was left in ruins. The inside of the hospital is dark and quiet. Then, out of nowhere, an eerie sound is heard.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou collect 10 books while exploring the dark hospital. By collecting books, the door will open and you can escape.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHowever, it is also important to be careful not to be seen by the dragon. When the dragon spots you, it will attack you mercilessly. If the player is spotted by a dragon, the game is immediately over.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCan you escape from the hospital safely?",
